 (rc msg)←SendMail_DeletedPkg(INI ID);domain;gatekeeper;body;subject
⍝ Notifies the gatekeeper(s) that one or more packages got deleted.
⍝ The email as such is sent by `SendMail`.
 rc←0 ⋄ msg←''
 :If INI.Get'EMAIL:active'
 :AndIf INI.Exist'EMAIL:gatekeeper'
 :AndIf 0<≢gatekeeper←⊃INI.Get'EMAIL:gatekeeper'
     domain←⊃INI.Get'EMAIL:Domain'
     body←ID
     subject←(⍕≢ID),' package got deleted on ',domain
     (rc msg)←SendMail INI subject body gatekeeper
 :EndIf
⍝Done
